        "Description": "Donny &quot;Crack-Shot&quot; Jeffords gained notoriety as a prolific &quot;fixer&quot; for the Fitzpatrick family. He grew to be feared all across East Harlem as a mobster, murderer, and all-around monster. He became particularly well-known for the hits he performed with his pistol, these hits laid the foundation for his extensive wealth.\r\rNow, Jeffords is relaxing on Haven Island, preparing for a transition to a new identity. Let&apos;s ensure that this mobster gets what he deserves.",
